<title>UK: UK's Clarke to hold news conference at 1145 GMT.</title>
<headline>UK's Clarke to hold news conference at 1145 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chancellor of the Exchequer Kenneth Clarke will hold a news conference at Conservative Central Office at 1145 GMT on Monday, the Conservative party said.</p>
<p>He will be accompanied by party chairman Brian Mawhinney.</p>
</text>
